<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) — Piet Mondrian</title>
<meta name="description" content="Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow, 1930: a De Stijl painting of asymmetric balance.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#d6261c;--blue:#1d3f8f;--yellow:#f4c90f;--black:#111;--white:#f7f5ef;--grey:#d9d8d3;--line:clamp(8px,1.4vw,16px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--black);color:var(--black);font:400 1.05rem/1.6 Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit}
.grid{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:var(--line);min-height:100vh}
.cell{background:var(--white);padding:clamp(1rem,3vw,2.5rem)}
.red{background:var(--red);color:var(--white)}.blue{background:var(--blue);color:var(--white)}.yellow{background:var(--yellow)}.grey{background:var(--grey)}
h1,h2{font-family:"Archivo Black",Impact,sans-serif;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,6vw,5.2rem)}h2{font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,2rem);margin-bottom:.6rem}
.kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em;font-weight:600;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 2.2fr;grid-template-rows:2fr 1fr .5fr}
.hero .title{grid-column:1/2;grid-row:1/3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
.hero .big{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.hero .big p{font-family:"Archivo Black",sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3rem,12vw,10rem);line-height:.85}
.hero .sub{grid-column:2;grid-row:2/4}
.hero .b{grid-column:1;grid-row:3}
dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;gap:.3rem 1.2rem}dt{font-weight:600}
.info{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;min-height:auto}
.painting{grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;min-height:auto}
.art{aspect-ratio:1;background:var(--black);display:grid;gap:6%;padding:0;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;grid-template-rows:3fr 1fr;max-width:420px;width:100%}
.art div{background:var(--white)}
.art .r{background:var(--red)}.art .bl{background:var(--blue)}
.art .br{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 1fr;gap:12%;background:var(--black)}
.art .br div:last-child{background:var(--yellow)}
.art .tl{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:12%;background:var(--black)}
.cta{grid-template-columns:3fr 1fr;min-height:auto}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:.9rem 1.4rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:4px solid var(--black)}
.btn:hover,.btn:focus-visible{background:var(--red);outline:none}
@media(max-width:760px){.hero,.info,.painting,.cta{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}.hero>*{grid-column:auto!important;grid-row:auto!important}.hero .b{min-height:3rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="grid hero" aria-labelledby="t">
  <div class="cell title"><p class="kicker">Piet Mondrian · De Stijl</p><h1 id="t">Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1></div>
  <div class="cell red big" aria-hidden="true"><p>1930</p></div>
  <div class="cell sub"><p class="kicker">The painting</p><p>Painted in 1930 by the Dutch painter Piet Mondrian (1872–1944), oil on canvas, now in the Kunsthaus Zurich. Also listed as <em>Composition II in Red, Blue, and Yellow</em>.</p></div>
  <div class="cell blue b" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<section class="grid info">
